          "content": "**(e) For the tank to be full, how long should the tap be running? Ans:** $\\frac { 1 0 } { 7 }$ hours"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.236,
            0.883,
            0.349
          ],
          "content": "**2. The government has taken** $\\frac{1}{6}$ **of Somu’s land to build a road. What part of the land remains with Somu now? She gives half of the remaining part of the land to her daughter Krishna and** $\\frac{1}{3}$ **of it to her son Bora. After giving them their shares, she keeps the remaining land for herself.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.351,
            0.657,
            0.37
          ],
          "content": "(a) What part of the original land did Krishna get?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.37,
            0.627,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": "(b) What part of the original land did Bora get?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.389,
            0.757,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": "(c) What part of the original land did Somu keep for herself?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.422,
            0.553,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** Part of land that remains with somu $= \\frac{5}{6}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.45,
            0.229,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": "(a) $\\frac { 5 } { 1 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.487,
            0.229,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": "(b) $\\frac { 5 } { 1 8 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
