          ],
          "content": "**3. Find the area of a rectangle of sides 3** $\\frac{3}{4}$ **ft and 9** $\\frac{3}{5}$ **ft.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.656,
            0.264,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 36 sq. ft."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.688,
            0.881,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": "**4. Tsewang plants four saplings in a row in his garden. The distance between two saplings is** $\\frac { 3 } { 4 }   \\mathbf { m }$ **. Find the distance between the first and last sapling.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.756,
            0.236,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** $2   \\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ m"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.796,
            0.65,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": "**5. Which is heavier:** $\\frac { 1 2 } { 1 5 }$ <strong><sub>of</sub></strong> **500 grams or** $\\frac { 3 } { 2 0 }$ **of 4 kg? Ans:** ${ \\frac { 3 } { 2 0 } }   \\mathrm { o f }   4   \\mathrm { k g }$ is heavier than $\\frac{12}{15}$ <sub>of</sub> 500 gm."
